cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "prob-reco-sbi: probabilistic event reconstruction with simulation-based inference"
abstract: >-
  Course material on probabilistic event reconstruction with simulation-based inference. The first part,
  "A Flash in the Dark", is a photon-transport simulation of a toy two-dimensional scintillation detector with
  switchable absorption, Rayleigh scattering and wall reflection, a documented HDF5 data format and student tasks
  about the simulated data.
authors:
